# Dataset — hosted on HF: EdgeDeID/synthetic-dataset
# Anchored with a leading slash: an unanchored `data/` also matches the
# edgedeid/data/ source package and silently un-tracks it (which dropped the data
# package during the /edgedeid refactor). Anchoring ignores only the top-level
# dataset dir, so no per-directory negation is needed.
/data/
datasets--EdgeDeID--synthetic-dataset/

